    abstract = "This work focuses on exploring the use of Generative Artificial Intelligence to assist end-users in creating immersive experiences. We present a prototype that supports the creation and edition of virtual environments using speech commands expressed in natural language.",
    booktitle = "Proceedings of the 2024 International Conference on Advanced Visual Interfaces",
