    author = "Natale, Simone and Biggio, Federico and Arora, Payal and Downey, John and Fassone, Riccardo and Grohmann, Rafael and Guzman, Andrea and Keightley, Emily and Ji, Deqiang and Obia, Vincent and Przegalinska, Aleksandra and Raman, Usha and Ricaurte, Paola and Villanueva-Mansilla, Eduardo",
