    url = "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1877050925023300",
    keywords = "Virtual Exhibitions, Creative AI, Generative AI, Human-Robot Collaboration",
    abstract = "The paper presents the impact of Creative AI and Generative AI in the cultural heritage sector, especially in the virtual exhibitions redesign and reinterpretation of artworks, which provide a more immersive, personalized, and informative experience by adding AI-driven features. A case study of integrating creative AI into a virtual exhibition is described and a comparative analysis between a famous original artwork and the AI-generated reinterpretation is performed. Combining virtual exhibitions with Creative AI opens up some novel opportunities, for example how these two concepts can integrate to enhance collaboration and to create high-level experiences for visitors. The current paper blends insights from art, AI, human-robot collaboration, and digital media, showing how technology can redefine visitor engagement in cultural spaces."
}

