    url = "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/B9780323956895002388",
    keywords = "Artificial intelligence, Chatbot, Generative AI, Information discovery, Information needs, Information retrieval, Information seeking, Misinformation, Search engines, Social media, Social networks",
    abstract = "Information is the key to supporting decision making in everyone’s life. The internet provides individuals with a plethora of resources through different services, such as search engines, social media, and chatbots. These services allow people to collect information in easier and more convenient ways through searching and browsing different sources or connecting with experts worldwide. However, it is important to be aware of technological limitations and ethical issues when retrieving results or responses when internet services are used. Being information literate is essential for everyone in today’s information-rich environment."
}

